# Shared ignore rules for the Apart AI x Epistemics sprint folders.
# (Experiment 2's own .gitignore is part of its frozen pilot snapshot and is left unchanged.)

# Private transcripts / post text: never commit
**/local_private/

# Secrets
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key

# Virtualenvs and caches
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
